sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant CLI
    participant SpecSync
    participant Loader
    participant NotationSync
    participant StoreAPI
    User->>CLI: spec2viz diagram sync a.yml b.yml --strict
    rect rgba(127, 127, 127, 0.1)
    Note over CLI,SpecSync: loop for each spec
    CLI->>SpecSync: sync(path, notation)
    SpecSync->>Loader: load(path)
    Loader->>SpecSync: BaseDiagram or ParseError
    end
    rect rgba(127, 127, 127, 0.1)
    Note over SpecSync,NotationSync: alt the diagram type has a notation
    SpecSync->>NotationSync: sync(name, finish=False)
    NotationSync->>StoreAPI: create_document / save_document_payload (NotationDoc, GlyphDoc, LinkDoc)
    StoreAPI->>NotationSync: documents
    end
    rect rgba(127, 127, 127, 0.1)
    Note over SpecSync,StoreAPI: loop for each spec
    SpecSync->>StoreAPI: upsert SpecNodeDoc, SpecDoc, RelationDoc (attributes)
    SpecSync->>StoreAPI: rebuild_edges() / check_edges()
    StoreAPI->>SpecSync: edge errors
    SpecSync->>CLI: SyncReport
    end
    CLI->>User: one line per spec#59; exit 1 if --strict and problems